WEBVTT

00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:08.070
There exists a private school where students with the powers of Elements have gathered.

00:00:08.070 --> 00:00:09.980
This school is known as Tenbi Academy.

00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:12.950
But within this school,

00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:16.990
there are students who choose to use their powers to cause trouble.

00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:20.750
In response to this serious problem,

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:23.960
the school decided to form a group led by students from the Student Council,

00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:26.210
which became known as the Magical Security Organization.

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:29.590
Using sacred treasures called Maken,

00:00:29.590 --> 00:00:32.260
they endeavor to thwart those who use their Element to commit crimes.

00:00:32.260 --> 00:00:35.050
The people refer to these students as Maken-ki.

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:42.810
daiji na koto ha muzukashii koto janakute

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:42.810
Important things are not complicated things

00:00:42.810 --> 00:00:52.300
mune ni himeta daisuki na kimochi

00:00:42.810 --> 00:00:52.300
They are feelings hidden within your chest

00:01:03.410 --> 00:01:09.240
otome no you ni rakuen wo yume mite

00:01:03.410 --> 00:01:09.240
Like a maiden, dream of paradise

00:01:09.240 --> 00:01:14.840
negau yori mo kanae ni dekakeyou

00:01:09.240 --> 00:01:14.840
Instead of just wishing for it, let's go out and make it a reality

00:01:14.840 --> 00:01:25.680
baiburu ni mo tekisuto ni sae mo kaitenai koto taiken shiyou

00:01:14.840 --> 00:01:25.680
Let's experience things that haven't been written in the bible or in textbooks

00:01:25.910 --> 00:01:31.210
yaritai koto ya naritai mono

00:01:25.910 --> 00:01:31.210
Things you want to do and things you want to become

00:01:31.210 --> 00:01:36.900
zenbu jiyuu jizai jibun shidai

00:01:31.210 --> 00:01:36.900
You have the freedom to do anything

00:01:36.900 --> 00:01:42.790
taisetsu dakara mamoritai wake janakute

00:01:36.900 --> 00:01:42.790
It's not that you want to protect them because they're important

00:01:42.990 --> 00:01:48.040
jidouteki ni dakishimeteru

00:01:42.990 --> 00:01:48.040
You automatically hold them close

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:54.050
daiji na koto ha muzukashii koto janakute

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:54.050
Important things are not complicated things

00:01:54.410 --> 00:02:03.270
mune ni himeta daisuki na kimochi

00:01:54.410 --> 00:02:03.270
They are feelings hidden within your chest

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:22.660
Oh, hey, hey! Satou-san!

00:02:24.700 --> 00:02:26.200
Stop it.

00:02:26.200 --> 00:02:28.540
She's always reading manga by herself.

00:02:28.540 --> 00:02:30.340
We shouldn't bother her.

00:02:30.340 --> 00:02:31.330
I see.

00:02:31.830 --> 00:02:34.460
Oh yeah! Did you end up going to that café near the station?

00:02:34.710 --> 00:02:36.010
I did! I did!

00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:37.210
What?! I haven't gone yet!

00:02:52.610 --> 00:02:54.940
Oh, you like that manga?

00:02:54.940 --> 00:02:56.900
I'm a big fan of that one, too!

00:03:18.460 --> 00:03:21.880
I think we'll get along really well!

00:03:30.640 --> 00:03:33.600
Now, turn to page thirty-two of your textbooks.

00:03:33.940 --> 00:03:36.650
When you wish to find the angle of B...

00:03:38.030 --> 00:03:39.190
Chacha...

00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:41.610
And Kimi, too.

00:03:46.620 --> 00:03:50.450
Don't you think Chacha and Kimi have been acting kinda strange lately?

00:03:50.450 --> 00:03:51.250
Hm?

00:03:51.250 --> 00:03:52.870
Yeah, now that you mention it...

00:03:54.790 --> 00:03:56.670
They were even sleeping during P.E.

00:03:57.040 --> 00:03:58.210
Those two...

00:03:59.300 --> 00:04:01.260
Do you think they're up to something?

00:04:01.260 --> 00:04:04.300
They're always reading all sorts of manga.

00:04:04.550 --> 00:04:08.810
Maybe they've turned to a new kind of hobby, and every night...

00:04:09.220 --> 00:04:11.890
No, you can't. Not there!

00:04:11.890 --> 00:04:14.810
You and I are a couple of frisky kittens.

00:04:15.690 --> 00:04:17.190
No way.

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:19.070
Huh?

00:04:19.140 --> 00:04:23.070
No, you can't. Not there!

00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:28.700
You and I are a couple of frisky kittens.

00:04:31.370 --> 00:04:36.380
Wait, both of you! I'm...

00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:41.420
Don't squeeze them!

00:04:39.090 --> 00:04:40.460
Is it here?

00:04:42.510 --> 00:04:44.970
I-Impure... Impure!

00:04:45.260 --> 00:04:47.340
Hey, now. Seriously? Even Kodama?

00:04:47.590 --> 00:04:49.850
Y-You're wrong! Don't get the wrong idea!

00:04:49.850 --> 00:04:51.220
This is... Oh!

00:04:55.810 --> 00:04:57.520
Did we get here at just the right time?

00:04:57.520 --> 00:04:59.020
Could this be a secret flower garden of love?

00:04:59.900 --> 00:05:01.690
I'll blow you away!

00:05:01.690 --> 00:05:03.320
Japan is number one!

00:05:05.070 --> 00:05:06.200
Ten-Man?

00:05:06.200 --> 00:05:07.360
That's right!

00:05:07.360 --> 00:05:11.290
Officially, it's called "the Tenbi Manga Festival," though.

00:05:11.290 --> 00:05:16.290
It's an event held within Tenbi for people who love manga.

00:05:16.290 --> 00:05:19.960
There's going to be cosplay, doujinshi selling, and even a masquerade.

00:05:19.960 --> 00:05:22.000
We're going to do all three!

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:23.300
All three of them?

00:05:23.550 --> 00:05:25.300
I'll be cosplaying,

00:05:25.300 --> 00:05:27.050
and Kimi will be selling her doujinshi.

00:05:27.380 --> 00:05:29.800
What's a masquerade?

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:32.060
It's an event where people perform skits while dressed in cosplay.

00:05:32.600 --> 00:05:37.140
Um, that is what you saw Kodama-chan doing a moment ago...

00:05:38.190 --> 00:05:41.860
I couldn't think of a good idea for the masquerade,

00:05:41.860 --> 00:05:43.780
so she was helping me come up with one.

00:05:43.950 --> 00:05:46.150
Oh, so that's what you were doing.

00:05:46.150 --> 00:05:48.490
That's why I told you that you had the wrong idea!

00:05:48.490 --> 00:05:52.910
Then, the reason you two have been dozing off in class so much lately is...

00:05:52.910 --> 00:05:57.160
Yeah. Actually, I'm also stuck on my manga project.

00:05:57.430 --> 00:05:58.500
So...

00:06:02.210 --> 00:06:02.920
What?

00:06:03.090 --> 00:06:07.220
Kimi wants to use you and Kengo as models.

00:06:07.220 --> 00:06:08.180
Models?

00:06:08.760 --> 00:06:12.810
You just need to get naked and hold each other in a passionate embrace.

00:06:13.070 --> 00:06:14.470
That's not happening.

00:06:14.560 --> 00:06:16.310
I definitely won't let that happen!

00:06:16.530 --> 00:06:21.190
Actually, I can't seem to find a character that suits me well, either.

00:06:21.520 --> 00:06:23.610
B-But don't worry.

00:06:23.610 --> 00:06:27.360
I'll try my best to make sure this doesn't hinder our Maken-ki activities.

00:06:27.950 --> 00:06:31.030
So...

00:06:32.910 --> 00:06:33.740
Kimi?!

00:06:35.240 --> 00:06:36.750
Please let her be.

00:06:37.010 --> 00:06:40.250
She hasn't had a good sleep for a long time now.

00:06:40.250 --> 00:06:46.550
If she doesn't pay attention, she... ends up... falling asl—

00:06:47.090 --> 00:06:49.470
It looks like the same goes for you!

00:06:52.010 --> 00:06:54.720
I understand. I'll help out, too.

00:06:55.100 --> 00:06:55.890
Huh?

00:06:55.890 --> 00:06:56.810
But...

00:06:56.810 --> 00:07:00.100
After seeing you like this, I can't let you do it by yourselves.

00:07:00.100 --> 00:07:02.030
I'll help, as well!

00:07:02.030 --> 00:07:05.360
Me, too! I'll help you with anything, except modeling.

00:07:05.520 --> 00:07:07.320
I was already on board, so it's not like I'd leave now.

00:07:07.610 --> 00:07:10.400
I'll go wherever Himegami-senpai goes!

00:07:10.780 --> 00:07:13.160
Well, I guess I have no choice.

00:07:18.120 --> 00:07:20.120
We have to work hard, then!

00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:23.580
Yeah!

00:07:26.420 --> 00:07:29.050
We're doing <i>this</i> sort of thing again?

00:07:30.670 --> 00:07:33.970
I-It tickles!

00:07:34.760 --> 00:07:38.020
E-Even if you say that...

00:07:40.390 --> 00:07:43.020
Wh-Why do <i>I</i> have to do this?

00:07:45.770 --> 00:07:47.270
These are pose reference photos!

00:07:47.860 --> 00:07:49.740
Pose reference photos!

00:07:49.740 --> 00:07:51.700
They're going in my own personal collection!

00:07:51.900 --> 00:07:52.820
Quit snapping!

00:07:52.820 --> 00:07:53.780
Don't move!

00:07:55.120 --> 00:07:56.120
Let's do another round!

00:07:56.780 --> 00:07:57.160
Ah!

00:07:57.160 --> 00:07:57.910
Whoa!

00:07:57.910 --> 00:07:59.120
K-Kimi...

00:07:58.620 --> 00:07:59.790
Don't move!

00:07:59.540 --> 00:08:04.960
Another round! Yes, yes, I'll take it! No, no! Give me more!

00:08:04.960 --> 00:08:05.920
Whoa!

00:08:05.920 --> 00:08:07.590
Hey, Takeru, I can't see! You bastard!

00:08:08.500 --> 00:08:09.510
Whoa!

00:08:21.810 --> 00:08:24.520
Takeru! Your thing's poking me! It's poking me! Gross!

00:08:32.490 --> 00:08:33.990
It's done!

00:08:38.160 --> 00:08:40.990
Oh, you finished it? Let me see.

00:08:40.990 --> 00:08:42.700
I want to see it, too!

00:08:43.040 --> 00:08:44.410
O-Okay!

00:08:46.830 --> 00:08:49.550
Huh, what is... this?

00:08:49.550 --> 00:08:54.680
It's a scene in which Blue and Green push Black and Red down.

00:08:54.680 --> 00:08:56.340
You drew it perfectly.

00:08:56.340 --> 00:08:56.890
What?!

00:08:57.050 --> 00:08:59.780
Look, these action lines right here

00:08:59.780 --> 00:09:03.100
really bring it to life, don't you think?

00:09:04.270 --> 00:09:06.560
Ah... yeah.

00:09:07.020 --> 00:09:11.020
The sound effects and lettering are really good, too... yeah.

00:09:11.020 --> 00:09:12.610
You're so talented!

00:10:55.920 --> 00:10:58.050
Takeru-sama. Takeru-sama.

00:10:58.050 --> 00:10:58.800
Hm?

00:11:13.770 --> 00:11:15.400
Hey, Kimi.

00:11:16.020 --> 00:11:16.900
Yes?

00:11:17.610 --> 00:11:19.900
You're finished with your manga, aren't you?

00:11:20.400 --> 00:11:21.820
What are you still doing up?

00:11:22.700 --> 00:11:25.200
I'm making souvenirs for the people who buy it.

00:11:25.200 --> 00:11:27.790
They're tokens of my appreciation.

00:11:30.250 --> 00:11:31.290
I see.

00:11:31.790 --> 00:11:32.960
What are you doing, Chacha?

00:11:33.460 --> 00:11:35.750
You've already finished your costume, haven't you?

00:11:36.250 --> 00:11:37.710
Why are you still up?

00:11:37.710 --> 00:11:41.720
My costume is finished because everyone helped me with it,

00:11:42.090 --> 00:11:44.010
so I want to make sure it's perfect.

00:11:44.010 --> 00:11:45.350
I want it to be the best it can be.

00:11:45.800 --> 00:11:48.970
Now I'm just making some last-minute adjustments.

00:11:50.770 --> 00:11:51.850
I see.

00:12:07.950 --> 00:12:09.410
Hey, Kimi.

00:12:09.410 --> 00:12:10.000
Hm?

00:12:10.540 --> 00:12:14.620
Let's have a really great time tomorrow!

00:12:15.880 --> 00:12:16.710
Yeah!

00:12:24.050 --> 00:12:27.260
Thank you for waiting, everyone!

00:12:27.800 --> 00:12:33.810
Well then, the Tenbi Manga Festival, "Ten-Man", will now begin!

00:12:50.580 --> 00:12:52.410
I'd like to buy one of these, please.

00:12:52.410 --> 00:12:54.080
Here you go. Thank you very much.

00:12:54.080 --> 00:12:55.540
Thank you very much!

00:12:55.540 --> 00:12:58.420
I'm so excited! I can't wait to get home and start reading this!

00:12:58.670 --> 00:13:00.250
There are so many people here.

00:13:00.550 --> 00:13:02.260
Yes, as expected of a festival like this.

00:13:02.510 --> 00:13:05.010
Compact full open!

00:13:05.010 --> 00:13:07.930
Maximizing Mirror World connections!

00:13:07.930 --> 00:13:11.770
The brand-new Kaleid Liner, Prisma Illya.

00:13:12.030 --> 00:13:13.020
Cute.

00:13:13.020 --> 00:13:14.980
So cute!

00:13:15.440 --> 00:13:16.810
Cute!

00:13:16.810 --> 00:13:17.980
Cute!

00:13:17.980 --> 00:13:20.520
Come on, Himegami-san, Azuki-san.

00:13:20.940 --> 00:13:23.650
Are they really here?

00:13:23.650 --> 00:13:25.280
Yeah, they should be.

00:13:25.280 --> 00:13:29.160
Treasured books you can't normally obtain as a high school student.

00:13:29.160 --> 00:13:31.700
I'm sure they're being sold somewhere in this exhibition hall.

00:13:31.740 --> 00:13:33.540
Oh, yeah!

00:13:34.000 --> 00:13:35.830
There's nothing like that here.

00:13:36.040 --> 00:13:36.790
B-But...

00:13:36.790 --> 00:13:37.960
There's not!

00:13:37.960 --> 00:13:38.750
Right.

00:13:40.540 --> 00:13:42.800
Thank you all for waiting!

00:13:42.800 --> 00:13:48.550
The Tenbi Manga Festival Masquerade Contest will soon begin!

00:13:52.100 --> 00:13:55.020
Goodness. What are those two doing?

00:13:55.020 --> 00:13:56.640
It's almost time.

00:13:56.640 --> 00:13:57.940
Oh, they're here!

00:13:58.400 --> 00:13:59.730
S-Sorry!

00:13:59.730 --> 00:14:02.110
They wouldn't let us go.

00:14:02.110 --> 00:14:04.110
It's fine. Just hurry up and get changed.

00:14:05.320 --> 00:14:09.700
By the way, Kimi. How was your first taste of the festival?

00:14:10.450 --> 00:14:13.740
It was really fun! I sold a heap of books!

00:14:13.740 --> 00:14:14.830
They sold?!

00:14:14.830 --> 00:14:16.410
Yes! I sold out.

00:14:16.410 --> 00:14:17.330
Sold out?!

00:14:17.330 --> 00:14:19.880
And one of the circles I love even

00:14:19.880 --> 00:14:23.340
drew one of my favorite characters in my sketchbook!

00:14:23.340 --> 00:14:28.010
It was a perfect pairing! My eyes have been opened!

00:14:28.010 --> 00:14:30.180
The order is important, after all!

00:14:30.180 --> 00:14:31.680
It is a deep world.

00:14:32.640 --> 00:14:35.270
How about you, Chacha? Did you have fun?

00:14:35.270 --> 00:14:39.350
Of course I did. It was the best! I'm doing what I love, aren't I?

00:14:39.350 --> 00:14:40.480
That's right.

00:14:40.480 --> 00:14:43.060
But it's not over yet.

00:14:43.400 --> 00:14:46.150
We have to create even more wonderful memories.

00:14:49.280 --> 00:14:50.360
That's right!

00:14:50.360 --> 00:14:51.160
Yeah!

00:14:51.780 --> 00:14:58.710
Okay then, would the first group, team No Name, please take to the stage!

00:15:02.500 --> 00:15:04.210
Sorry we're late!

00:15:04.210 --> 00:15:07.260
Oh, the first group just went on.

00:15:07.590 --> 00:15:09.800
Really? Thank goodness we made it.

00:15:21.690 --> 00:15:24.200
Thanks, Kimi.

00:15:24.200 --> 00:15:24.940
Huh?

00:15:25.320 --> 00:15:30.900
I was really happy when you said you'd do the masquerade with me.

00:15:31.240 --> 00:15:34.120
Just relax and enjoy yourself!

00:15:36.790 --> 00:15:37.660
Okay!

00:15:41.410 --> 00:15:42.670
M-My costume!

00:15:44.880 --> 00:15:46.000
It's doing this on its own!

00:16:12.990 --> 00:16:14.360
Are you all right?

00:16:14.360 --> 00:16:15.660
Hurry and take cover!

00:16:15.660 --> 00:16:17.030
R-Right!

00:16:17.950 --> 00:16:18.910
This is...

00:16:19.330 --> 00:16:20.790
A Maken.

00:16:21.000 --> 00:16:21.910
Everyone!

00:16:35.680 --> 00:16:37.430
These things are way too tough!

00:16:39.810 --> 00:16:41.640
Maken Knuckle Kamudo!

00:16:42.600 --> 00:16:44.310
Thank you, Inaho!

00:16:44.310 --> 00:16:45.980
Leave it to me!

00:16:45.980 --> 00:16:48.110
Go, Ikadzuchi, Kaguzuchi!

00:16:59.240 --> 00:17:02.410
Maken Tablet Comic Star!

00:17:25.690 --> 00:17:27.900
Hold on! I'll save you!

00:17:29.730 --> 00:17:30.230
Shunt!

00:17:35.950 --> 00:17:39.120
Oh, sorry! I went a little overboard.

00:17:40.160 --> 00:17:42.580
This is what your lecherous behavior gets you.

00:17:42.580 --> 00:17:45.160
I-It was just a bit of harmless fun.

00:17:45.910 --> 00:17:48.500
Maken Scale Compressor!

00:17:51.460 --> 00:17:55.260
I'll just put this here, and... Physical Drive!

00:17:56.760 --> 00:17:59.010
Now, hurry and get away from here.

00:17:59.010 --> 00:18:00.300
O-Okay.

00:18:02.720 --> 00:18:03.600
Kimi!

00:18:07.810 --> 00:18:09.350
I can't forgive this!

00:18:09.770 --> 00:18:10.560
Yeah.

00:18:11.560 --> 00:18:16.150
Everyone worked so hard to make these.

00:18:17.900 --> 00:18:19.700
I won't forgive them!

00:18:22.200 --> 00:18:24.330
Ah, this is awesome.

00:18:24.330 --> 00:18:27.460
It really is, but soon...

00:18:27.460 --> 00:18:29.620
Yes, this was inevitable.

00:18:29.920 --> 00:18:32.670
Looks like it's already being dealt with.

00:18:35.340 --> 00:18:39.050
Are you two the ones responsible for this?

00:18:39.050 --> 00:18:39.840
Huh?

00:18:39.840 --> 00:18:43.720
What makes you think that? We're victims, as well.

00:18:43.720 --> 00:18:45.770
Do you really think we're going to believe that?

00:18:45.770 --> 00:18:50.230
In a situation like this, the ones who are watching calmly...

00:18:50.560 --> 00:18:52.400
are most likely the culprits!

00:18:59.200 --> 00:19:00.910
Why did you do this?!

00:19:00.910 --> 00:19:02.410
It's obvious!

00:19:02.870 --> 00:19:09.040
We did it so we could see the faces of the cosplayers we like contorted in pain!

00:19:09.040 --> 00:19:11.080
It's the best!

00:19:11.080 --> 00:19:15.920
We let them experience what their characters are subjected to in manga.

00:19:16.130 --> 00:19:19.050
I think we should be thanked for our good deeds.

00:19:19.380 --> 00:19:20.760
You two...

00:19:20.760 --> 00:19:21.380
Huh?

00:19:21.800 --> 00:19:25.640
Don't you love manga and anime, too?

00:19:26.680 --> 00:19:27.770
Then why...?

00:19:29.140 --> 00:19:33.020
I can't forgive those who try to ruin what other people love!

00:19:33.020 --> 00:19:35.690
I don't care about other people!

00:19:35.690 --> 00:19:38.360
Our enjoyment is all that matters!

00:19:38.610 --> 00:19:42.200
Maken Scale Compressor!

00:19:49.870 --> 00:19:52.670
Maken Tablet Comic Star!

00:19:55.250 --> 00:19:57.500
Too bad!

00:19:58.500 --> 00:19:59.960
Then, take this!

00:20:08.010 --> 00:20:08.970
No way!

00:20:08.970 --> 00:20:10.430
She can even dodge bullets?!

00:20:11.390 --> 00:20:13.390
Are you guys ready?

00:20:17.150 --> 00:20:21.570
I'll use Physical Overdrive to make this a Zoom Punch!

00:20:35.040 --> 00:20:36.290
I-It's over?

00:20:36.960 --> 00:20:38.630
We did it, Kimi!

00:20:40.000 --> 00:20:40.800
But...

00:20:41.970 --> 00:20:47.600
Everything that everyone worked so hard on is ruined.

00:20:56.190 --> 00:20:57.980
It's not like this is the last chance we'll get to do this, you know?

00:20:58.730 --> 00:21:00.480
We can always participate again next time.

00:21:05.150 --> 00:21:08.370
Yeah, you're right!

00:21:14.540 --> 00:21:16.790
W-Wait a second!

00:21:17.040 --> 00:21:18.460
Why are we doing this again?!

00:21:18.460 --> 00:21:20.210
Aren't we done yet?!

