00:21:45.450 --> 00:21:47.320
Could this be a secret flower garden of love?

00:21:48.360 --> 00:21:50.700
I'll blow you away!

00:21:50.700 --> 00:21:54.040
As we thought! Japan is number one!

00:22:12.550 --> 00:22:16.760
shou ni to kurai machigatte mo ii

