Let's find the first page of our new future together

00:22:57.440 --> 00:23:00.040
Let's go! Let's go!

00:23:00.040 --> 00:23:07.180
narihibiku munasawagi no ashita he

00:23:00.040 --> 00:23:07.180
To the tomorrow that makes your heart flutter

